This product serves the Google Tag Manager tools of google-tag-manager-mcp-core,
part of Stape's Google Tag Manager MCP server
(https://github.com/stape-io/google-tag-manager-mcp-server), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. Stape is not affiliated with foro.sh, and this
server is not a Stape product.

What foro.sh changed, without modifying Stape's code:

- Each Stape tool is served as a read tool plus one tool per Google OAuth scope
  its other actions need (tools.ts). An action not classified there is not
  served.
- Google sign-in and token refresh are foro.sh's: the server gets each
  caller's access token from foro's upstream broker (broker.ts) instead of
  Stape's Cloudflare Worker OAuth.
- The server speaks streamable HTTP from Node (server.ts) instead of stdio or a
  Cloudflare Worker.
